#: src/admin/documentation.php:40
msgid "Serves the state schools on that page, whatever the General tab says; network=\"city\" serves the city schools."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/documentation.php:41
msgid "Every release also publishes a single HTML file with both forms, for an iframe on a site without WordPress; add ?form=teachers to its address for the teachers' form and ?network=state for the state schools. It uses the built-in defaults, not these settings."
msgstr ""

